1
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:04,173
Gus? Are you okay?

2
00:00:04,223 --> 00:00:07,448
My stomach... hurts...

3
00:00:08,748 --> 00:00:14,149
Five burger wrappers?! We are going to the doctor!

4
00:00:14,199 --> 00:00:16,615
The doctor?! No no no!

5
00:00:20,465 --> 00:00:23,016
Doctors have needles!

6
00:00:23,066 --> 00:00:26,192
Doctor Max is just going to examine you.

7
00:00:26,242 --> 00:00:29,389
That is exactly what a doctor with needles would say!

8
00:00:32,089 --> 00:00:37,222
Hello! I am Doctor Max. What is the problem?

9
00:00:37,272 --> 00:00:39,559
My stomach hurts!

10
00:00:39,609 --> 00:00:43,177
What did you eat today?

11
00:00:43,227 --> 00:00:50,919
One burger... two... three... four... five burgers.

12
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:56,473
Five burgers. For breakfast.

13
00:00:56,523 --> 00:00:58,783
They were small burgers!

14
00:01:03,633 --> 00:01:07,093
Open your mouth, please.

15
00:01:08,543 --> 00:01:11,144
...That is a very big mouth.

16
00:01:11,194 --> 00:01:13,796
It is a beak!

17
00:01:13,846 --> 00:01:16,993
Now... does it hurt here?

18
00:01:17,393 --> 00:01:19,809
AAAH! Yes! It hurts!

19
00:01:21,309 --> 00:01:23,254
...I did not touch you yet.

20
00:01:30,054 --> 00:01:34,667
You ate too much. Five burgers is too much!

21
00:01:34,717 --> 00:01:36,534
No medicine?

22
00:01:36,584 --> 00:01:41,717
No. Drink some water and no more burgers today.

23
00:01:41,767 --> 00:01:43,713
That sounds worse than medicine!

24
00:01:45,813 --> 00:01:48,022
How do you feel?

25
00:01:48,072 --> 00:01:50,644
I feel better! Much better!

26
00:01:51,344 --> 00:01:52,794
...What about pizza?

27
00:01:53,294 --> 00:01:55,004
GUS!

28
00:01:55,704 --> 00:01:58,434
Let us practice! Say it with me!

29
00:01:58,534 --> 00:01:59,748
What's the problem?

30
00:02:01,848 --> 00:02:03,454
My stomach hurts.

31
00:02:05,554 --> 00:02:06,769
Does it hurt here?

32
00:02:08,869 --> 00:02:10,658
I feel better!

33
00:02:13,158 --> 00:02:16,233
Quick quiz! Why does Gus's stomach hurt?

34
00:02:16,283 --> 00:02:20,371
A: He ate too much. Or B: He has a headache.

35
00:02:23,271 --> 00:02:26,000
A! He ate too much!

36
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:34,907
Now you try! My... blank... hurts. Write your answer in the comments!

37
00:02:35,707 --> 00:02:37,894
See you next time! Bye!

38
00:02:37,944 --> 00:02:39,237
Bye bye!
